hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,arabic,grades,reference,international_number,narrator_chain,chapter_intro}:
"204","وَفيكَ بارَكَ الله","","","","","Prayer of the traveller as dawn approaches"
"205","اللّهُـمَّ لا طَيْـرَ إِلاّ طَيْـرُك، وَلا خَـيْرَ إِلاّ خَـيْرُك، وَلا إِلهَ غَيْـرُك","","","","","Prayer of the traveller as dawn approaches"
